Kernel_setNonce
├── when caller is not EntryPoint setNonce
│   └── it should revert with Unauthorized error
└── when caller is EntryPoint or self setNonce
    ├── given seq is greater than current sequence for the nonceKey
    │   └── it should update the nonce sequence to seq
    ├── given seq is equal to current sequence
    │   └── it should revert with InvalidNonce error
    └── given seq is less than current sequence
        └── it should revert with InvalidNonce error
